<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"5.3_Tracking_Event">5.3 Tracking Even=
t</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracke=
t">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_Ti=
GR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;section=3D12" title=3D"Edit section: 5.=
3 Tracking Event" class=3D"mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></=
a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href=3D"https://wiki.=
itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;s=
ection=3D12" title=3D"Edit section's source code: 5.3 Tracking Event"><span=
>edit source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></spa=
n></h3>
<figure class=3D"mw-halign-left" typeof=3D"mw:File/Frameless"><span title=
=3D"Mandatory"><img alt=3D"Mandatory" src=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/image=
s/e/e3/Mandatory.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"35" height=3D"33" class=
=3D"mw-file-element"></span><figcaption>Mandatory</figcaption></figure><p>A=
 tracking event - code EV00 - shall be sent at regular intervals, when the =
vehicle is powered ON<sup id=3D"cite_ref-7" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"=
https://wiki.itxpt.org/docs/S03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3#cite_note-7"><span class=
=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>7<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> =
and even if during the interval other events appeared.
</p><p>The period is specified by Telediagnostic service supplier.
</p><p>The recommended period is 120 seconds.
</p><p>As TRACKING type, the =E2=80=9Ctracking=E2=80=9D event shall comply =
with standard format of structure "Header" + " EvtTRK" as defined in 12.2 b=
elow.
</p><p>For each Tracking event the following context data are provided:
</p>
