<h3><span id=3D"6.1_Vehicles_pre-equipped_with_VehMan_.E2.80.9Cnative_solut=
ions.E2.80.9D"></span><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"6.1_Vehicles_pre-eq=
uipped_with_VehMan_=E2=80=9Cnative_solutions=E2=80=9D">6.1 Vehicles pre-equ=
ipped with VehMan =E2=80=9Cnative solutions=E2=80=9D</span><span class=3D"m=
w-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"ht=
tps://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=
=3Dedit&amp;section=3D14" title=3D"Edit section: 6.1 Vehicles pre-equipped =
with VehMan =E2=80=9Cnative solutions=E2=80=9D" class=3D"mw-editsection-vis=
ualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divider"> | <=
/span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_=
v3.0.3&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;section=3D14" title=3D"Edit section's source c=
ode: 6.1 Vehicles pre-equipped with VehMan =E2=80=9Cnative solutions=E2=80=
=9D"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</=
span></span></h3>
<p>The minimum list of faults to be detected by the VehMan OBU and provided=
 to Telediagnostic server shall be defined by the Fleet Owner in the Tender=
 and/or Purchase Contract for new vehicles supply.=20
</p><p>The transcodification of =E2=80=9Cnative=E2=80=9D FM fault codes int=
o TiGR Event codes shall be based on =E2=80=9Ctranslation tables=E2=80=9D i=
mplemented in the VehMan web service Client.=20
</p><p>=E2=80=9CNative=E2=80=9D FM fault code is defined as =E2=80=9CCodeVM=
C=E2=80=9D in =E2=80=9CExtra=E2=80=9D data for Fault ON event.
</p><p>TiGR Event code is defined as =E2=80=9CCODE=E2=80=9D in Event Header=
.
</p><p>The translation tables for each vehicle model shall be agreed betwee=
n the VehMan and Telediagnostic service supplier.
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"6.2_FMS_based_applications">6.2 FMS b=
ased applications</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-ed=
itsection-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?ti=
tle=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;section=3D15" title=3D"=
Edit section: 6.2 FMS based applications" class=3D"mw-editsection-visualedi=
tor"><span>edit</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divider"> | </span>=
<a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3=
&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;section=3D15" title=3D"Edit section's source code: 6=
.2 FMS based applications"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-ed=
itsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p>The following paragraphs are reserved for FMS based applications.
</p>
<h4><span id=3D"TTS_management.5B9.5D"></span><span class=3D"mw-headline" i=
d=3D"TTS_management[9]">TTS management<sup id=3D"cite_ref-9" class=3D"refer=
ence"><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/docs/S03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3#cite_not=
e-9"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>9<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</=
span></a></sup></span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-edit=
section-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?titl=
e=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;section=3D16" title=3D"Ed=
it section: TTS management[9]" class=3D"mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>=
edit</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href=3D"=
https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;action=
=3Dedit&amp;section=3D16" title=3D"Edit section's source code: TTS manageme=
nt[9]"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]=
</span></span></h4>
<p>Tell-tale Status (TTS) reproduces dashboard lights condition.
</p><p>TTS are defined in [3] - msg FMS Tell Tale Status: FMS1 =E2=80=93 PG=
N FD7D.
</p>
<h4><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"6.2.1_TTS_condition">6.2.1 TTS condit=
ion</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=3D"mw-editsection-brac=
ket">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_=
TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;section=3D17" title=3D"Edit section: =
6.2.1 TTS condition" class=3D"mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span=
></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href=3D"https://wi=
ki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;action=3Dedit&am=
p;section=3D17" title=3D"Edit section's source code: 6.2.1 TTS condition"><=
span>edit source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span><=
/span></h4>
<p>For each Tell-tale, 4 valid binary condition values are defined accordin=
g to [3]:
</p>
<ul><li>000 =3D Off</li>
<li>001 =3D Alert (red)</li>
<li>010 =3D Alarm (yellow)</li>
<li>011 =3D Info</li></ul>
<p><u>Note</u>: Condition =E2=80=9C111 =3D not available=E2=80=9D is not mo=
nitored.
</p><p>Only TTS changes relevant for Telediagnostic service shall generate =
events for Telediagnostic server.
</p><p>The list of TTS ID and condition to be monitored by the Data Acquisi=
tion System shall be agreed with Telediagnostic service supplier.
</p>
<h4><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"6.2.2_Implementation_of_FMS_TTS">6.2.=
2 Implementation of FMS TTS</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span clas=
s=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/in=
dex.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;section=3D18"=
 title=3D"Edit section: 6.2.2 Implementation of FMS TTS" class=3D"mw-editse=
ction-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-divi=
der"> | </span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01=
-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;section=3D18" title=3D"Edit section's=
 source code: 6.2.2 Implementation of FMS TTS"><span>edit source</span></a>=
<span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4>
<p>A =E2=80=9CTTS0=E2=80=9D Event is used for reporting TTS changes as defi=
ned in 7.2.2.
</p>
<ul><li>A =E2=80=9CTTS0=E2=80=9D event with TYPE =E2=80=9CEVENT_ON=E2=80=9D=
 shall be issued every time a TTS enters in a new monitored status.</li>
<li>A corresponding =E2=80=9CTTS0=E2=80=9D Event with TYPE =E2=80=9CEVENT_O=
FF=E2=80=9D shall be issued when the pending monitored status is terminated=
.</li></ul>
<table class=3D"wikitable" style=3D"background-color:white;" cellpadding=3D=
"5">
