</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><b>Table 5- TTS0 Event</b>
</p><p><u>Note</u>: In case of transition from one monitored state to anoth=
er monitored state, two TiGR events shall then be issued: one EVENT_OFF and=
 one EVENT_ON.
</p><p><span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/docs/File=
:S03P01-TTS0_transition.png" class=3D"mw-file-description"><img src=3D"http=
s://wiki.itxpt.org/w/images/thumb/4/40/S03P01-TTS0_transition.png/500px-S03=
P01-TTS0_transition.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"500" height=3D"221" cl=
ass=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p><p><i><b>Figure 5- TTS0 transition states sequence diagram</b></i>
</p>
<h4><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"6.2.3_Alternators_status_monitoring">=
6.2.3 Alternators status monitoring</span><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><s=
pan class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.=
org/w/index.php?title=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;veaction=3Dedit&amp;secti=
on=3D19" title=3D"Edit section: 6.2.3 Alternators status monitoring" class=
=3D"mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class=3D"mw-edi=
tsection-divider"> | </span><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/w/index.php?t=
itle=3DS03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;section=3D19" title=3D"E=
dit section's source code: 6.2.3 Alternators status monitoring"><span>edit =
source</span></a><span class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h4=
>
<p>The error status of alternators is reported in FMS message =E2=80=9CAS=
=E2=80=9D - PGN 00FED5, Byte 3<sup id=3D"cite_ref-10" class=3D"reference"><=
a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/docs/S03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3#cite_note-10"><=
span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span>10<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span>=
</a></sup> as defined in [3].
</p><p>An event ON / OFF - code FE01 - shall be issued <u>for each alternat=
or</u> reported in fault in FMS message (value =E2=80=9C10=E2=80=9D). The f=
ield =E2=80=9CALTERNATORID=E2=80=9D in the EXTRA structure shall be used to=
 specify the alternator in fault (4 alternators are defined in FMS).
</p><p><u>FE01 events triggered by FMS message =E2=80=9CAS=E2=80=9D shall b=
e issued independently of Events eventually triggered by TTS ID 12</u><sup =
id=3D"cite_ref-11" class=3D"reference"><a href=3D"https://wiki.itxpt.org/do=
cs/S03P01-_TiGR_-_v3.0.3#cite_note-11"><span class=3D"cite-bracket">[</span=
>11<span class=3D"cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup>
</p>
