<th colspan=3D"3">Document history
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>v3.0.3
</td>
<td>October 2026
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>new =C2=A78.1 and =C2=A78.2 to clarify that the system diagnostics =
shall use the same ON/OFF as ITS faults</li>
<li>VHM is not applicable for Hybrid and the related energy column is updat=
ed accordingly to support Hybrid Plugin only</li>
<li>CHS is not applicable for Hybrid and the related energy column is updat=
ed accordingly to support Hybrid Plugin only</li>
<li>alignment of =C2=A712.2 reference and extra structure reference for ITS=
 faults</li></ul>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>V3.0.2
</td>
<td>February 2026
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>HBT and LBT declared as integer instead of float in EvtTRK, EvtON, =
EvtOFF</li>
<li>LOA and LAC declared as float instead of integer in EvtON and EvtOFF</l=
i></ul>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>V3.0.1
</td>
<td>October 2025
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>add "MSOH" &amp; "PCBS" in tables of =C2=A712.2 and =C2=A713</li>
<li>remove all "TX" references</li>
<li>add J1939 for PCBS and MSOH</li>
<li>add J1939 reference for PBCL</li>
<li>fix of few editorial misalignments <small>(merged cells in table, line =
breaks...)</small></li></ul>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>V3.0.0
</td>
<td>September 2024
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Fix of misaligned mapping between HBC / LBC  and related J1939 refe=
rences</li>
<li>Add mapping between HBT / LBT and related  J1939 references</li>
<li>Add definition of vehicle modes (standby,  driving and charging)</li>
<li>Add new DateTime TRSDATE</li>
<li>Add diagram for DateTime, chapter 4.1</li>
<li>Add diagrams for event sequences scenarios</li>
<li>Update of some data types (positiveInteger,  positiveLong and float)</l=
i>
<li>Remove of TX attribute (redundant with TYPE)</li>
<li>Update of TYPE structure as an enum</li>
<li>Add definition of HEAD</li>
<li>Fix of TFU &amp; PTEO description</li>
<li>Updated reference to FMS version 05</li>
<li>Alignment of format for not valid or not  available parameter (based on=
 S02P00)</li>
<li>Removal  of lsb reference in the description for non-CAN-based paramete=
r</li></ul>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
